0.4.0 (2026-08-21)
  * Error handling for all samplers.
  * Improved numerical stability of tail-probability calculations in pseudo-target functions.
  * Corrected errors with ESS (specify likelihood instead of target) and GESS (pass Cholesky flag to ESS).
  * Corrected AUC/MSW histogram calculations with unequal bin widths; implemented AUC by numerical integration.
  * Streamlined pseudo-target utility functions.
  * Deprecated function auc() and use of degf for pseudo-target degrees of freedom.

0.3.1 (2024-05-29)
  * A few cosmetic improvements based on CRAN feedback.

0.3.0 (2024-05-28)
  * Initial submission to CRAN.

